    "formula": "<p><strong>Ânion gap</strong> = Na⁺ − (Cl⁻ + HCO₃⁻).</p><p><strong>Corrigido pela albumina</strong> = AG + 2,5 × (4,0 − albumina em g/dL).</p><p><strong>Razão delta</strong> = (AG − 12) ÷ (24 − HCO₃⁻).</p>",
